          {
            "title": "As",
            "id": 88741,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si rinomina un modulo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con la parola chiave <code>as</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con la parola chiave <code>from</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Con la parola chiave <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con la parola chiave <code>as</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo la parola chiave <code>as</code> per rinominare un modulo nel nostro codice.</p><p>Quale riga importa <code>math</code> con il nome più breve <code>m</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>import math as m</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>import m as math</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>from math import m</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>import math as m</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: From",
            "id": 88739,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come importiamo parti delle funzionalità di un modulo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con la parola chiave <code>from</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con la parola chiave <code>as</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Con la parola chiave <code>in</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con la parola chiave <code>from</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo la parola chiave <code>from</code> per importare parte delle funzionalità di un modulo.</p><p>Quale riga importa solo <code>sqrt</code> da <code>math</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>from math import sqrt</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>import math</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>from sqrt import math</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>from math import sqrt</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Mean",
            "id": 88743,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importa il modulo <code>statistics</code> seguito dal modulo <code>math</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" statistics, math    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total_plays = [\" /><text value=\"232\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"43\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"345\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"23\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>statistics, math</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Module",
            "id": 88736,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"equation = \" /><text value=\"&quot;user defined&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;The root of 100 is&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(math.sqrt(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'istruzione di importazione è incompleta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il modulo <code>equation</code> non viene importato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato in questo codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'istruzione di importazione è incompleta.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale sostituzione per la prima riga incompleta rende disponibile <code>math.sqrt(100)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"equation = \" /><text value=\"&quot;user defined&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;The root of 100 is&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(math.sqrt(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>import math</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>import equation</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>import sqrt</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>import math</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Help",
            "id": 88738,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa l'istruzione <code>help()</code> quando viene usata con un modulo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fornisce una descrizione delle funzionalità del modulo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Impedisce al modulo di generare errori</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Memorizza il modulo all'interno di una nuova variabile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fornisce una descrizione delle funzionalità del modulo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando viene usata con un modulo, <code>help()</code> descrive le funzionalità fornite dal modulo.</p><p>Dopo <code>import math</code>, quale riga chiede a Python di fornire questa descrizione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>help(math)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>math.help()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>help = \"math\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>help(math)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Library",
            "id": 124672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa dobbiamo fare prima di poter usare i moduli nel nostro codice?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Installa le librerie che contengono i moduli</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chiedi il permesso al creatore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Niente, importa solo i moduli</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Installa le librerie che contengono i moduli.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Documentation",
            "id": 124673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come facciamo a sapere se una libreria dispone dei moduli di cui abbiamo bisogno?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Controlla la documentazione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usiamo la libreria e riceveremo un errore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è modo di saperlo, prova a tentare la fortuna</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Controlla la documentazione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Import from library",
            "id": 124677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per fare in modo che il nostro programma attenda, ci serve il modulo <code>sleep</code> dalla libreria <code>time</code>. Scrivi il codice per importare <strong>solo</strong> quel modulo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" time \" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sleep\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This message is shown immediately.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sleep(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This message is shown after a 1-second delay.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"install\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"This message is shown immediately.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"This message is shown after a 1-second delay.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>from</code>, seguito da <code>time</code> e poi <code>import</code>, <code>sleep</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      }
